	(gr_text "order of copper layers:\n    Copper 1: F.Cu (front)\n    Copper 2: In1.Cu\n    Copper 3: In2.Cu\n    Copper 4: In3.Cu\n    Copper 5: In4.Cu\n    Copper 6: B.Cu (back)\n\nPCB description: 6 layer PCB 1.6 mm\n    Copper 1: 0.035 mm\n    Dielectric 1-2: 3313 prepreg 0.0994 mm\n    Copper 2: 0.0152 mm\n    Dielectric 2-3: 0.55 mm\n    Copper 3: 0.0152 mm\n    Dielectric 3-4: 2116 prepreg 0.1088 mm\n    Copper 4: 0.0152 mm\n    Dielectric 4-5: 0.55 mm\n    Copper 5: 0.0152 mm\n    Dielectric 5-6: 3313 prepreg 0.0994 mm\n    Copper 6: 0.035 mm\n\n3313 prepreg substrate with Er=4.05\nrequired differential microstrip impedance:\n    5 mil trace, 5 mil space: 90 ohm (±10%)\ntwo sided solder mask\ntwo sided silkscreen\ntwo sided assembly\n0.1 mm minimum trace width\n0.1 mm minimum isolation\n0.15 mm minimum drill\n0.2 mm board edge routing tolerance"
